{"logId": "96b9c42f-a03f-401c-b819-eeae6a6e84d1", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——理财", "block_bbox": [165, 140, 455, 173], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 140.0], [455.0, 140.0], [455.0, 173.0], [165.0, 173.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "主题释义：", "block_bbox": [184, 215, 284, 241], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[184.0, 215.0], [284.0, 215.0], [284.0, 241.0], [184.0, 241.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "拥有正确的物质观和幸福观，懂得用能力创造财富，不急功近利、与人攀比，也不让责任和欲望大于能力，科学合理地支配收入，健康、轻松、快乐地规划生活。在一定的物质水平基础上，能够驾驭金钱，看开金钱，更注重精神价值的创造和分享，达到非常满足圆润的生命状态！", "block_bbox": [183, 264, 1017, 406], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 264.0], [1017.0, 264.0], [1017.0, 406.0], [183.0, 406.0]]}, {"block_label": "figure_title", "block_content": "[74]", "block_bbox": [573, 716, 611, 739], "block_id": 3, "block_order": null, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[573.0, 716.0], [610.0, 716.0], [610.0, 738.0], [573.0, 738.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——理财", "block_bbox": [201, 900, 491, 932], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 900.0], [491.0, 900.0], [491.0, 932.0], [201.0, 932.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "标准等级：", "block_bbox": [225, 975, 326, 1002], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[225.0, 975.0], [326.0, 975.0], [326.0, 1002.0], [225.0, 1002.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "一级【0~1分】：不因物质、金钱等给自己或他人造成沉重的经济压力、精神包袱，甚至痛苦和伤害。（底线原则）", "block_bbox": [225, 1027, 1051, 1084], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[225.0, 1027.0], [1051.0, 1027.0], [1051.0, 1084.0], [225.0, 1084.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "二级【1~2分】：侧重于追求更多的金钱和物质，缺少了对现有生活的体验和享受。（生存阶段）", "block_bbox": [225, 1095, 1016, 1120], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[225.0, 1095.0], [1016.0, 1095.0], [1016.0, 1120.0], [225.0, 1120.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "三级【2~3分】：不让欲望大于能力，能够合理地支配收入，有正确、理性的金钱观，知足常乐。（由生存走向生活）", "block_bbox": [225, 1129, 1053, 1186], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[225.0, 1129.0], [1053.0, 1129.0], [1053.0, 1186.0], [225.0, 1186.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "四级【3~4分】：能够轻松驾驭金钱，金钱和物质的多少不影响生活的幸福度，更在意精神价值的创造。（生活阶段）", "block_bbox": [224, 1196, 1051, 1252], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[224.0, 1196.0], [1051.0, 1196.0], [1051.0, 1252.0], [224.0, 1252.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "五级【4~5分】：面对一切得失都坦然从容，即便一无所有也保持满足圆润的生命状态。", "block_bbox": [225, 1263, 942, 1289], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[225.0, 1263.0], [942.0, 1263.0], [942.0, 1289.0], [225.0, 1289.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[75]", "block_bbox": [611, 1477, 650, 1498], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[611.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1497.0], [611.0, 1497.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7528271079063416, "coordinate": [165, 140, 455, 173], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[165.0, 140.0], [455.0, 140.0], [455.0, 173.0], [165.0, 173.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_